<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="ballot-head"><div class="bar"></div><div class="hairlines"></div></div>
<p class="eyebrow">Tamper-evident log — <%= currentLocal.name %></p>
<h1>Audit log</h1>
<div class="seal-strip">
  <strong>Chain verification:</strong>
  <% if (chain.ok) { %>intact — every one of <%= chain.total %> entries for this local hashes correctly against its predecessor.<% } else { %><span style="color:var(--signal)"><strong>BROKEN at entry #<%= chain.brokenAt %></strong> — the log has been altered.</span><% } %>
  <% if (chain.tip) { %><div class="tip">Chain tip: <%= chain.tip %></div><% } %>
</div>
<p class="sub">This is <strong><%= currentLocal.name %></strong>'s own hash chain: every entry commits
to the previous entry of this local, so the complete chain verifies without reference to any other
local hosted on this platform. Ballot casting appears only as anonymous counter events — the log
never records who cast which ballot or any ballot contents.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>When (UTC)</th><th>Actor</th><th>Event</th><th>Detail</th></tr>
<% rows.forEach(function (r) { %>
<tr><td><%= r.id %></td><td class="mono"><%= r.at %></td><td><%= r.actor %></td><td class="mono"><%= r.event %></td><td><%= r.detail || '' %></td></tr>
<% }) %>
</table>

<h2>Instance-wide voter-portal security events</h2>
<p class="sub">Rejected credentials and rate-limited addresses match <em>no</em> election, so they
cannot be attributed to any one local — they are recorded on the platform's own chain and shown
here (to every local's observers) so tamper-alert visibility is never lost. These events are
anonymous by design: no name, address, or credential value is ever recorded.</p>
<% if (securityEvents.length === 0) { %>
  <div class="notice">None recorded.</div>
<% } else { %>
<table>
<tr><th>When (UTC)</th><th>Event</th><th>Detail</th></tr>
<% securityEvents.forEach(function (r) { %>
<tr><td class="mono"><%= r.at %></td><td class="mono"><%= r.event %></td><td><%= r.detail || '' %></td></tr>
<% }) %>
</table>
<% } %>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
